{"id":"espada","lemma":"espada","pos":"noun","rank":1176,"glosses":["sword (a long bladed weapon with a grip and typically a pommel and crossguard (together forming a hilt), which is designed to cut, stab, slash and/or hack)","spade (playing card marked with the symbol ♠)","épée (fencing sword of a certain modern type)"],"ipa":"/esˈpada/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"espadas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-espada.wav","examples":[{"text":"Dame mi espada.","en":"Give me my sword.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442405","words":[{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Yo no tengo una espada.","en":"I don't have a sword.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453488","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Tengo el rey de espadas.","en":"I have the King of Spades.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"king"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Tom está entre la espada y la pared.","en":"Tom is caught between a rock and a hard place.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/801936","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"between"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"wall"}]},{"text":"Sus espadas chocaron.","en":"Their swords clashed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636472","words":[{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null,{"g":"to crash","l":"chocar"}]}]}